      children: "Beyond encryption, consider implementing access policies that classify documents by sensitivity and restrict operations accordingly. Work documents might be accessible during business hours only, personal financial information might require additional authentication factors, and shared family documents might have different permission levels for different users. Regular security audits-reviewing access logs, validating encryption implementations, checking for dependency vulnerabilities with tools like Snyk or Dependabot-are essential for maintaining security posture over time."
